{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993720/extras/baa0d20666a803e9af034892dffce62a.avif?t=1758861077\" width=600 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moonlit Mountain holds divine mysteries, perpetually shrouded in dense fog that prevents ordinary people from entering. However, the protagonist discovers a magical lantern capable of dispersing the mist, granting free access to this forbidden zone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993720/extras/9291e97fc151cbffbb0f3f31f892984a.poster.avif?t=1758861077\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993720/extras/9291e97fc151cbffbb0f3f31f892984a.webm?t=1758861077\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993720/extras/9291e97fc151cbffbb0f3f31f892984a.mp4?t=1758861077\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993720/extras/42dd7e169c0c32d36cb0dad1ab5e0509.avif?t=1758861077\" width=600 height=79 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt for ingredients by day and operate your tavern at night. Earn gold to upgrade equipment, improve tavern levels, and hire helpful staff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993720/extras/6830730906c64822959b42095fb1a05a.poster.avif?t=1758861077\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3993720/extras